{"id":"qaXRTmFycQc5UnLY","meta":{"instanceId":"9c9d1384dfdc68ee21a851dd40fbe2f518f8a52c75fd88358946849fc2cad20c"},"name":"Transcribe Audio Files Using Online Speech to Text Cloud API","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"650692fd-10ec-47b6-ab27-0d45182bb239","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,-32],"parameters":{"width":880,"height":480,"content":"## Transcribe Audio Files Using Online Speech to Text Cloud API\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow manually starts an audio transcription job using an online Speech to Text Cloud API. It sets the audio URL and transcription options, downloads the audio file, submits it for transcription, then polls the job status until processing is finished. Once complete, it retrieves the final transcript.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure credentials for the Speech to Text Cloud API nodes.\n- Set the `audio_url`, `language`, and `output_format` values in the Set Audio Parameters node.\n- Ensure the audio URL is reachable by the workflow, or configure authentication in the Fetch Audio File HTTP request if the file is private.\n- Adjust the wait duration and status condition to match the API's expected processing time and response format.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the language, output format, polling interval, or completion condition to fit the speech-to-text provider and desired transcript format."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9819442a-45f6-4bd1-8ba1-60303b4fa14a","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,480],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":320,"content":"## Manual input setup\n\nStarts the workflow manually and defines the audio URL plus transcription options that the rest of the workflow will use."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"28e799e0-38b1-4c56-8de2-4b97a36cc06a","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[448,480],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":320,"content":"## Fetch and submit audio\n\nDownloads the configured audio file and sends it to the Speech to Text Cloud API to start a transcription job."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"4a6caa1c-5e91-4d5d-8c05-555d7521d46d","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1008,368],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":352,"content":"## Poll transcription status\n\nWaits between checks, retrieves the current transcription job status, and loops back until the job is marked as finished."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d9ea11e9-6134-4cbd-93d8-8b581488b655","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1552,400],"parameters":{"color":7,"height":400,"content":"## Retrieve final transcript\n\nFetches the completed transcription result from the Speech to Text Cloud API after the status check succeeds."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e543280f-667a-43ae-90dd-01d83234e157","name":"When Started Manually","type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","position":[48,640],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"70c9f517-f991-4948-97a2-45f2d5fb5d51","name":"Fetch Audio from URL","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[496,640],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json.audio_url }}","options":{}},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"f7909ca8-fff5-4c3c-a542-7f326906503e","name":"Transcribe Audio File","type":"n8n-nodes-speech-to-text-cloud.speechToTextCloud","position":[720,640],"parameters":{"language":"={{ $json.language }}","requestOptions":{}},"credentials":{"speechToTextCloudApi":{"id":"HzhMEC4i7w9TncKj","name":"Speech To Text Cloud account"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"92bc04eb-742d-4fd7-a410-ecafa4f571e6","name":"Wait for Transcription","type":"n8n-nodes-base.wait","position":[944,640],"webhookId":"ce6be096-4826-406b-9352-a43d5c1609fe","parameters":{},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"f0837e15-6a85-4189-a0c9-3a639b30628b","name":"If Transcription Complete","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1392,640],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"0876acda-b18e-4435-96b5-db4db45010b3","operator":{"name":"filter.operator.equals","type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"1d2013ba-fec5-4691-814c-167bd80d80b1","name":"Fetch Transcription Status","type":"n8n-nodes-speech-to-text-cloud.speechToTextCloud","position":[1168,560],"parameters":{"jobId":"={{ $('Transcribe Audio File').item.json.job_id }}","operation":"get","requestOptions":{}},"credentials":{"speechToTextCloudApi":{"id":"HzhMEC4i7w9TncKj","name":"Speech To Text Cloud account"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ed999857-e39d-42d0-ad86-7ea22c267ba4","name":"Retrieve Final Transcript","type":"n8n-nodes-speech-to-text-cloud.speechToTextCloud","position":[1616,640],"parameters":{"jobId":"={{ $('Transcribe Audio File').item.json.job_id }}","operation":"get","requestOptions":{}},"credentials":{"speechToTextCloudApi":{"id":"HzhMEC4i7w9TncKj","name":"Speech To Text Cloud account"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"15db0f40-03b7-4b9a-b7aa-ff99d15ea3d4","name":"Set Audio Parameters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[272,640],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"aa8e6803-82bc-4c17-b410-7b6b607b2a51","name":"audio_url","type":"string","value":"https://www.raspberry-fertig.de/cloud/public.php/dav/files/H2dJKABksbMykrT/"},{"id":"b3a92b8c-bdc7-4463-aea4-91b721a5a3f5","name":"language","type":"string","value":"yyy"},{"id":"ff8d5faa-d56a-46c9-b31e-ae810fe30854","name":"output_format","type":"string","value":"txt"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"e6dd0bc1-1aca-4323-a38e-174b7929ed38","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Fetch Audio from URL":{"main":[[{"node":"Transcribe Audio File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Set Audio Parameters":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Audio from URL","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Transcribe Audio File":{"main":[[{"node":"Wait for Transcription","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When Started Manually":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Audio Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Wait for Transcription":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Transcription Status","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If Transcription Complete":{"main":[[{"node":"Retrieve Final Transcript","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Wait for Transcription","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Transcription Status":{"main":[[{"node":"If Transcription Complete","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}